{"seq":5,"slug":"lc1584-min-cost-to-connect-all-points","title":"LeetCode 1584 连接所有点的最小费用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-graph-advanced/lc1584-min-cost-to-connect-all-points","wordCount":663,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-1584-连接所有点的最小费用\">LeetCode 1584 连接所有点的最小费用</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个 <code>points</code> 数组，其中 <code>points[i] = [xi, yi]</code> 表示二维平面上的一个点。连接两个点 <code>[xi, yi]</code> 和 <code>[xj, yj]</code> 的费用为它们之间的<strong>曼哈顿距离</strong>：<code>|xi - xj| + |yi - yj|</code>。</p>\n<p>请返回将所有点连接起来的<strong>最小总费用</strong>。只有任意两点之间<strong>恰好有一条简单路径</strong>时，才认为所有点都已连接。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= points.length &lt;= 1000</code></li>\n<li><code>-10^6 &lt;= xi, yi &lt;= 10^6</code></li>\n<li>所有点的坐标<strong>互不相同</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：points = [[0,0],[2,2],[3,10],[5,2],[7,0]]&#10;输出：20&#10;解释：最小生成树连接所有点，总费用为 20。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：points = [[0,0],[2,2],[3,10],[5,2],[7,0]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：最小生成树连接所有点，总费用为 20。</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：points = [[3,12],[-2,5],[-4,1]]&#10;输出：18\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：points = [[3,12],[-2,5],[-4,1]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：18</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题要求将 n 个点全部连通且总边权最小，这正是经典的<strong>最小生成树</strong>（Minimum Spanning Tree, MST）问题。</p>\n<p><strong>问题建模：</strong> 将每个点视为图的节点，任意两点之间都有一条边，边权为曼哈顿距离。这构成了一个<strong>完全图</strong>，共有 n(n-1)/2 条边。</p>\n<p><strong>Kruskal 算法：</strong> 将所有边按权重排序，从小到大依次加入，如果加入的边不形成环（用并查集判断），则选中。选够 n-1 条边后停止。</p>\n<p><strong>Prim 算法：</strong> 从任意一个点开始，维护一个&quot;已选集合&quot;。每次从未选点中选择到已选集合距离最小的点加入。适合稠密图（边数多），因为可以用邻接矩阵实现 O(V²)。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[最小生成树两种经典算法]&#10;    A --&gt; B[Kruskal]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Prim]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[所有边排序]&#10;    B1 --&gt; B2[并查集判断是否成环]&#10;    B2 --&gt; B3[贪心选 n-1 条边]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[从任一点出发]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C2[维护最小距离数组]&#10;    C2 --&gt; C3[每次选最近的未选点]\">graph TD\n    A[最小生成树两种经典算法]\n    A --&gt; B[Kruskal]\n    A --&gt; C[Prim]\n    B --&gt; B1[所有边排序]\n    B1 --&gt; B2[并查集判断是否成环]\n    B2 --&gt; B3[贪心选 n-1 条边]\n    C --&gt; C1[从任一点出发]\n    C1 --&gt; C2[维护最小距离数组]\n    C2 --&gt; C3[每次选最近的未选点]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Kruskal（排序+并查集）</td>\n<td>O(E log E)</td>\n<td>O(E)</td>\n<td>稀疏图（E 远小于 V²）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prim（邻接矩阵）</td>\n<td>O(V²)</td>\n<td>O(V²)</td>\n<td>稠密图 / 完全图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prim（优先队列）</td>\n<td>O(E log V)</td>\n<td>O(V + E)</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本题是完全图，E = V(V-1)/2 ≈ V²。Prim 的 O(V²) 实现最优，避免了对 V² 条边排序。但 Kruskal 代码更直观，在 V ≤ 1000 的约束下也完全可行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>Prim 算法（O(V²) 实现）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function minCostConnectPoints(points: number[][]): number {&#10;  const n = points.length;&#10;  const dist = new Array(n).fill(Infinity);&#10;  const inMST = new Array(n).fill(false);&#10;  dist[0] = 0;&#10;  let totalCost = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;    let u = -1;&#10;    for (let j = 0; j &lt; n; j++) {&#10;      if (!inMST[j] &amp;&amp; (u === -1 || dist[j] &lt; dist[u])) {&#10;        u = j;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    inMST[u] = true;&#10;    totalCost += dist[u];&#10;&#10;    for (let v = 0; v &lt; n; v++) {&#10;      if (!inMST[v]) {&#10;        const d = Math.abs(points[u][0] - points[v][0]) + Math.abs(points[u][1] - points[v][1]);&#10;        dist[v] = Math.min(dist[v], d);&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return totalCost;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> minCostConnectPoints</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">points</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> points.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dist</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Infinity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> inMST</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dist[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalCost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">inMST[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dist[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dist[u])) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    inMST[u] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    totalCost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dist[u];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; v</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-