n style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      totalCost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      edgeCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (edgeCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalCost;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Prim（邻接矩阵）</th>\n<th>Kruskal</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(V²)</td>\n<td>O(V² log V)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(V)</td>\n<td>O(V²)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Prim 分析：</strong> 外层循环 V 次，每次内部遍历 V 个节点找最小值和更新距离。总计 O(V²)。空间只需 dist 和 inMST 数组，O(V)。</p>\n<p><strong>Kruskal 分析：</strong> 生成所有边 O(V²)，排序 O(V² log V²) = O(V² log V)，并查集操作总计约 O(V² α(V))。排序主导，总计 O(V² log V)。空间需要存储所有边 O(V²)。</p>\n<p>在 V = 1000 时，Prim 约需 10⁶ 次操作，Kruskal 约需 5 × 10⁵ × 20 ≈ 10⁷ 次操作。两者都能轻松通过，但 Prim 更优。</p>\n<p><strong>选择建议：</strong> 面试中两种算法都要掌握。Kruskal 更适合稀疏图（边数远小于 V²），Prim 更适合稠密图和完全图。本题作为完全图，Prim 是更自然的选择。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 1584 连接所有点的最小费用","id":"leetcode-1584-连接所有点的最小费用"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 778 水位上升的泳池中游泳","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-graph-advanced/lc0778-swim-in-rising-water"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 269 火星词典","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-graph-advanced/lc0269-alien-dictionary"}}